# Single Responsibility Principle (SRP)

- Keep each module/class/function focused on one reason to change.
- If a component handles unrelated concerns (e.g., IO + business rules + formatting), split responsibilities.
- Prefer composition of small units over one large coordinator with mixed duties.
- Keep public APIs scoped to one purpose.

## Review checklist

- Can this change be described as one responsibility?
- Would unrelated requirement changes force edits in this same unit?
- Can a helper be extracted without changing behavior?
